            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#SPS">
                <p>To Apollo Belenus Augustus, Tiberius Claudius Aristio and his wife Cornelia Eutychiane, together with their Claudian children, Constantus, Ferocus, Eutychiane and Aristio, in fulfillment of the vow placed this statue of Cupid. The sign was granted by the decree of the town council. </p>
